#. module: account_bank_payment_txt_generator
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_bank_payment_txt_generator.field_res_bank_txt_config__rounding_method
msgid ""
"Defines how the amounts exported to the txt are rounded. The rounded amounts are used in the body (z_amount, z_cc_amount) and in the totals (z_total_amount, z_total_cc_amount), so the header always matches the sum of the body, grouped or not.\n"
"- Round each payment line: each payment line is rounded and then they are added. The total may differ from the rounded real total.\n"
"- Round total and distribute the difference: the real total is rounded and the difference is distributed one unit at a time among the lines with the highest decimal part."
msgstr ""
"Define cómo se redondean los importes exportados al txt. Los importes redondeados se usan en el detalle (z_amount, z_cc_amount) y en los totales (z_total_amount, z_total_cc_amount), por lo que el encabezado siempre coincide con la suma del detalle, agrupado o no.\n"
"- Redondear cada línea de pago: se redondea cada línea de pago y luego se suman. El total puede diferir del total real redondeado.\n"
"- Redondear el total y repartir la diferencia: se redondea el total real y la diferencia se reparte de a una unidad entre las líneas con mayor parte decimal."

